Agnes of God is a drama, mystery film directed by Norman Jewison.

3
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:48,000
When a dead newborn is found, wrapped in bloody sheets, in the bedroom wastebasket of a young novice, psychiatrist Martha Livingston is called in to
determine if the seemingly innocent novice, who knows nothing of sex or birth, is competent enough to stand trial for the murder of the baby.

